# ioBroker.enpal

Reads energy data from a local InfluxDB 2.x instance (Enpal solar system) and exposes ioBroker states.

## Stack

- JavaScript (no runtime build step)
- Node.js >= 22
- `@iobroker/adapter-core`
- Admin UI: `admin/jsonConfig.json` (JSON-Config)
- Data source: local InfluxDB, polled via HTTP/HTTPS

## Key files

- `main.js` — adapter logic (polling, Influx query, CSV parsing, states)
- `io-package.json` — metadata, native config, `info.connection`
- `admin/jsonConfig.json` — configuration UI
- `admin/i18n/*.json` — admin translations
- `.github/workflows/test-and-release.yml` — CI and release
- `.cursor/rules/` — AI coding guidelines (replaces former Copilot instructions)
